# The SD card page (source/screens/sdcard.c) in the light theme. At the
# card's root (#14): folders first, then files, the hidden rule's entries
# left out (CHEAT, SAVER, torii); each folder's item count fills in once the
# page rests. A on Long goes into it (the page change hashed every frame):
# the title bar shows the path's pills, the current folder tinted. START on
# a game opens the file popup (#15); Delete (its last item) asks, Cancel
# preselected; Cancel goes back to the popup, and File info (above Delete)
# shows the file's facts, its date
# the one mtools stamps every scenario's files with (tests/shots.py). B
# goes up, the cursor on the folder it left.
#! settings 28=1
-w "nav: home ready"
-k @8:LEFT -k @12:- -k @16:LEFT -k @20:- -k @24:LEFT -k @28:- -k @32:LEFT -k @36:- -k @40:A -k @44:-
-w "sdcard: counted /"
-s @2:root.png
-k @8:DOWN -k @12:- -k @20:A -k @24:-
-H @20:@44
-w "sdcard: ready /Long"
-s @1:folder.png
-k @8:DOWN -k @12:- -k @20:DOWN -k @24:- -k @32:START -k @36:-
-w "sdcard: popup"
-s @12:popup.png
-k @20:UP -k @24:- -k @44:A -k @48:-
-s @64:confirm.png
-k @72:B -k @76:-
-k @96:UP -k @100:- -k @108:A -k @112:-
-s @140:file-info.png
-k @150:A -k @154:-
-k @190:B -k @194:-
-w "sdcard: ready /"
-s @1:back.png
